["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">占める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">占</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>女性<rp>(</rp><rt>じょせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>全体<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>六割<rp>(</rp><rt>ろくわり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>占<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">女性占整体的六成。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">湿る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变得潮湿；变得湿润；变得潮；受潮；缺乏精力；情绪低落；精神不振；心情沮丧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141206\"><ruby>洗濯物<rp>(</rp><rt>せんたくもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>湿<rp>(</rp><rt>しめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The washing is still damp.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">締める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">系；扎；拧紧；系（领带、腰带）；扎紧；合计；求和；统计；严格对待；严厉要求；节省；节约；削减开支；腌制；腌渍；做寿司时加醋盐混合物；宰杀；杀死（鱼、家禽等）；严厉施压；镇压；严格控制</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228764\">いつもシートベルトを<ruby>締<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Always fasten your seatbelt.</span></div></li>