class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">车库；车棚；（火车、公共汽车等的）车辆段；库棚；电车库</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104645\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をバックさせて<ruby>車庫<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He backed his car into the garage.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">社交</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゃこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">社交；社会交往</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77238\"><ruby>六月<rp>(</rp><rt>ろくがつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はロンドンでは<ruby>社交<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>季節<rp>(</rp><rt>きせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">June is a social season in London.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">車掌</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゃしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（列车）乘务员；列车员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227438\">オレンジカードは<ruby>車掌<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>販売<rp>(</rp><rt>はんばい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;Orange Cards&quot; are available from the conductor.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">写真</span><span class=\"v-r\" la